=== KHONG PHAI KET QUA THAT - FILE CHAN CO Y ===
Dat ngay 19/10/2026 de tools/chay_pumsb.ps1 (ban dang chay, PID 17880) BO QUA muc
minUtil 5000000 va thoat sau khi xong muc 5.400.000.
Ly do: ngoai suy cho thay muc nay can ~34 h (5.200.000) va ~85 h (5.000.000) CPU.
Nhom quyet dinh dung lai sau 5.400.000 vi ba diem do da du chung minh ti le lech
tang dan, va danh CPU cho thi nghiem phan ra thanh phan E8/E9/C3/C10.
Co che: script bo qua muc nao co log chua chuoi "itemsets count".
Neu muon chay that muc nay thi XOA file nay roi chay lai script.
